  "comments": "<p>Cirsa is the leading multinational in the gaming and leisure sector in Spain and Latin America for creativity, innovation, professionalism, diversity, service and results.<br><br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61b2c8777a289.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61b2c8777a289.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://www.cirsa.com/cirsa/\">https://www.cirsa.com/cirsa/</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This 25-centavos token from Cirsa, based on its diameter, weight, cupronickel planchet, and an almost identical reverse design, is clearly inspired by the Argentine 25 Centavos coin issued from 1993 to 1996 (KM#110a)</p>",
